Subject: [PATCH] hw/misc: make firmware own engine completions

Route modeled engine results back through the management command portal so
firmware validates command identity, owns the terminal state transition, and
publishes the only host-visible completion. Preserve bounded ownership across
engine reset, queue reset, device reset, migration, and bridge disconnect.

---
